                    "edit": {
                        "type": "CheckBox"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "caption": "Type",
                    "name": "kind",
                    "width": "120px",
                    "add": "window",
                    "edit": {
                        "type": "Select",
                        "options": [
                            {
                                "caption": "Window",
                                "value": "window"
                            },
                            {
                                "caption": "Door",
                                "value": "door"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                },
                {
                    "caption": "Label (optional)",
                    "name": "label",
                    "width": "auto",
                    "add": "",
                    "edit": {
                        "type": "ValidationTextBox"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "caption": "Show label",
                    "name": "showLabel",
                    "width": "130px",
                    "add": true,
                    "edit": {
                        "type": "CheckBox"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "caption": "Icon closed",
                    "name": "iconClosed",
                    "width": "160px",
                    "add": "",
                    "edit": {
                        "type": "SelectIcon"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "caption": "Icon open",
                    "name": "iconOpen",
                    "width": "160px",
                    "add": "",
                    "edit": {
                        "type": "SelectIcon"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "caption": "Icon tilted",
                    "name": "iconTilted",
                    "width": "160px",
                    "add": "",
                    "edit": {
                        "type": "SelectIcon"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "Label",
            "caption": "Contact variable: Boolean variable of the reed contact, true = open. Enable Inverted for contacts that report true = closed (e.g. many Matter contact sensors). Without a label, the name of the device (parent instance) is used. Empty icons = default icon of the type."
        },
        {
            "type": "ExpansionPanel",
            "caption": "Window handles and locks",
            "items": [
                {
                    "type": "List",
                    "name": "Handles",
                    "caption": "Window handles and locks",
                    "rowCount": 6,
                    "add": true,
                    "delete": true,
                    "changeOrder": true,
                    "columns": [
                        {
                            "caption": "Window/door (contact variable from the list above)",
                            "name": "contactVariable",
                            "width": "300px",
                            "add": 0,
                            "edit": {
                                "type": "SelectVariable",
                                "validVariableTypes": [
                                    0
                                ]
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "caption": "Handle type",
                            "name": "handleType",
                            "width": "230px",
                            "add": "doorState",
                            "edit": {
                                "type": "Select",
                                "options": [
                                    {
                                        "caption": "Matter door state (e.g. Siegenia)",
                                        "value": "doorState"
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "caption": "Homematic rotary handle",
                                        "value": "homematic"
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "caption": "Handle position (optional)",
                            "name": "positionVariable",
                            "width": "240px",
                            "add": 0,
                            "edit": {
                                "type": "SelectVariable",
                                "validVariableTypes": [
                                    1
                                ]
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "caption": "Lock state (optional)",
                            "name": "lockStatusVariable",
                            "width": "220px",
                            "add": 0,
                            "edit": {
                                "type": "SelectVariable",
                                "validVariableTypes": [
                                    1
                                ]
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "caption": "Lock action (optional)",
                            "name": "lockActionVariable",
                            "width": "220px",
                            "add": 0,
                            "edit": {
                                "type": "SelectVariable",
                                "validVariableTypes": [
                                    1
                                ],
                                "requiredAction": 1
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "caption": "Label (optional)",
                            "name": "label",
                            "width": "auto",
                            "add": "",
                            "edit": {
                                "type": "ValidationTextBox"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "caption": "Confirm unlock",
                            "name": "confirmOpen",
                            "width": "140px",
                            "add": false,
                            "edit": {
                                "type": "CheckBox"
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "Label",
                    "caption": "Handle type Matter door state: DoorLock_DoorState (0 = open, 1 = closed, 2 = jammed, 3 = forced open, 4 = unknown error, 5 = tilted). Handle type Homematic rotary handle: STATE (0 = closed, 1 = tilted, 2 = open). Lock state: DoorLock_LockState, lock action: DoorLock_LockUnlockUnbolt (0 = open, 1 = unlock, 2 = lock)."
                },
                {
                    "type": "Label",
                    "caption": "Each entry needs a handle position, a lock (state and action) or both. Handles without motor: leave both lock variables empty. Door locks without handle (e.g. Nuki): leave the handle position empty; they can only be locked while the contact is closed. Handles with motor can only be locked while the handle reports closed."
                },
                {
                    "type": "Label",
                    "caption": "Each entry is shown at the bottom of the button: the handle as an arrow in its direction (down = closed, right = open, up = tilted) and the lock as a button that locks or unlocks directly. Tapping the button opens a menu with all details. The color of the button follows the contact: closed = green; while it is open, the handles show whether it is tilted. Locks only color their own button (green = locked, red = unlocked). Without a label, the name of the device (parent instance) is used."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "CheckBox",
            "name": "ShowStatus",
            "caption": "Show state as text below the button"
        },
        {
            "type": "CheckBox",
            "name": "ShowSummary",
            "caption": "Show summary above the buttons (e.g. \"2 open · 1 tilted\")"
        }
    ],
    "actions": [],
    "status": [
        {
            "code": 201,
            "icon": "error",
            "caption": "At least one window or door is invalid (contact variable missing or not Boolean). See the debug output."
        },
        {
            "code": 202,
            "icon": "error",
            "caption": "The list of windows and doors or of window handles could not be read."
        },
        {
            "code": 203,
            "icon": "error",
            "caption": "At least one window handle or lock is invalid (window/door not in the list, variable missing, not Integer, neither handle position nor lock, only one lock variable set or lock action without action). See the debug output."
        }
    ]
